function flowRecommendationStatusLabel(status){return ({pending:'待核准',approved:'已核准',rejected:'已駁回',applied:'已套用',voided:'已作廢'})[status]||status||'—';}
function flowRecommendationStatusClass(status){return ['pending','approved','rejected','applied','voided'].includes(String(status))?String(status):'pending';}
function flowAuditRecommendationTable(rows){
  const list=Array.isArray(rows)?rows:[],canDecide=['ADMIN','FINANCE'].includes(currentUser?.role_code);
  return `<div class="table-wrap"><table class="grid"><thead><tr><th>狀態／異常</th><th>來源／單號</th><th>日期</th><th>逾期／帳齡</th><th>剩餘量／金額</th><th>資金影響</th><th>異常原因</th><th>建議處理</th><th>決策</th></tr></thead><tbody>${list.map(row=>{const action=row.status==='pending'&&canDecide?`<button class="btn small primary" data-flow-rec-approve="${row.id}">核准</button> <button class="btn small" data-flow-rec-reject="${row.id}">駁回</button>`:'—';return `<tr><td><span class="flow-recommendation-status ${flowRecommendationStatusClass(row.status)}">${esc(flowRecommendationStatusLabel(row.status))}</span><br><small>${esc(row.issue_code)}</small></td><td><strong>${esc(row.source_document_no||row.source_key)}</strong><br><small>${esc(row.source_kind)}／${esc(row.flow_kind)}</small></td><td>${esc(displayDateOf(row.source_date))}<br><small>預計 ${esc(displayDateOf(row.expected_date)||'—')}／到期 ${esc(displayDateOf(row.due_date)||'—')}</small></td><td>${flowAuditNumber(row.overdue_days)} 天<br><small>${esc(row.aging_bucket||'未逾期')}</small></td><td>${flowAuditNumber(row.remaining_quantity)}<br>${flowAuditNumber(row.remaining_amount)} ${esc(row.currency_code||'TWD')}</td><td>${flowAuditNumber(row.financial_impact)}</td><td>${esc(row.reason)}</td><td>${esc(row.proposed_action)}</td><td>${action}${row.decision_note?`<br><small>${esc(row.decision_note)}</small>`:''}</td></tr>`;}).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="9" class="empty-hint">目前沒有符合條件的更正建議；可按「產生／更新建議」。</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div>`;
}
function renderFlowAuditRecommendationPanel(rows,kind){
  const list=Array.isArray(rows)?rows:[];
  return `<div class="panel flow-audit-recommendations"><div class="panel-head"><span>待核准更正建議（只寫入目標 ERP）</span><div class="panel-actions"><label class="flow-rec-filter-label">顯示</label><select data-flow-audit-recommendation-status><option value="pending">待核准</option><option value="approved">已核准</option><option value="rejected">已駁回</option><option value="all">全部</option></select><button class="btn primary" data-flow-audit-generate type="button">產生／更新建議</button></div></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="desc">異常原因會依公司別、日期起訖與截至日產生建議；核准／駁回只保留決策與事件歷程，不直接修改 SH／SC。核准後仍須由受控沖回、重開、重作或更正作業執行。</div>${flowAuditRecommendationTable(list)}</div></div>`;
}
async function loadFlowAuditRecommendations(kind){
  const host=$('#flowAuditRecommendations');if(!host)return;
  const selected=host.querySelector('[data-flow-audit-recommendation-status]')?.value||'pending';
  host.innerHTML='<div class="panel flow-audit-recommendations"><div class="panel-body"><div class="empty-hint">載入待核准更正建議…</div></div></div>';
  try{
    const flowKind=kind==='health'?'all':kind;
    const query=`${flowAuditQuery()}&flow_kind=${encodeURIComponent(flowKind)}&status=${encodeURIComponent(selected)}`;
    const rows=await api(`/api/flow-audit/recommendations?${query}`);
    host.innerHTML=renderFlowAuditRecommendationPanel(rows,kind);
    const statusSelect=host.querySelector('[data-flow-audit-recommendation-status]');if(statusSelect)statusSelect.value=selected;
    host.querySelector('[data-flow-audit-generate]')?.addEventListener('click',async()=>{
      try{
        const data=Object.fromEntries(new FormData($('#flowAuditFilter')));
        const result=await api('/api/flow-audit/recommendations/generate',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({...data,flow_kind:flowKind})});
        toast(`稽核建議已更新：候選 ${result.candidate_count||0} 筆，新增 ${result.created_count||0} 筆`);
        await loadFlowAuditRecommendations(kind);
      }catch(error){toast(error.message,true);}
    });
    statusSelect?.addEventListener('change',()=>loadFlowAuditRecommendations(kind));
    host.querySelectorAll('[data-flow-rec-approve],[data-flow-rec-reject]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',async()=>{
      const id=button.dataset.flowRecApprove||button.dataset.flowRecReject,approved=Boolean(button.dataset.flowRecApprove);
      const note=window.prompt(approved?'核准備註（可留白）':'駁回原因（可留白）',approved?'已核對異常，准予建立受控更正案件':'現階段保留異常警示')
      if(note===null)return;
      try{const filter=Object.fromEntries(new FormData($('#flowAuditFilter')));await api(`/api/flow-audit/recommendations/${id}/${approved?'approve':'reject'}`,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({source_database:filter.source_database||currentDatabase,note})});toast(approved?'更正建議已核准，請進入受控更正作業執行':'更正建議已駁回，異常警示與歷程已保留');await loadFlowAuditRecommendations(kind);}catch(error){toast(error.message,true);}
    }));
  }catch(error){host.innerHTML=`<div class="panel flow-audit-recommendations"><div class="panel-body"><div class="empty-hint">載入更正建議失敗：${esc(error.message)}</div></div></div>`;}
}
function renderFlowAuditScreen(screen){
  const kind=screen==='purchase-flow-audit'?'procurement':screen==='sales-flow-audit'?'sales':'health';
  const title=kind==='procurement'?'採購流程稽核（請購→採購→進貨→應付→付款）':kind==='sales'?'銷售流程稽核（報價→訂單→銷貨→應收→收款）':'營運健康度（採購／銷售／應收應付）';
  let body=flowAuditFilters();
  if(kind==='health')body+=`<div id="flowAuditHealth"></div>`;
  else body+=`<div id="flowAuditSummary"></div><div id="flowAuditSupplemental"></div><div class="panel"><div class="panel-head">流程明細（起點／來源／各段單據與狀態／剩餘數量／剩餘金額／逾期／資金影響／異常原因）</div><div class="panel-body"><div class="table-wrap"><table class="grid"><thead id="flowAuditHead"></thead><tbody id="flowAuditRows"></tbody></table></div></div></div>`;
  body+=`<div id="flowAuditRecommendations"></div>`;
  flowAuditShell(title,body);
  $('#flowAuditFilter').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();loadFlowAudit(kind);};
  $('#flowAuditReload').onclick=()=>loadFlowAudit(kind);
  loadFlowAudit(kind);
}
async function loadFlowAudit(kind){
  const requestId=++flowAuditRequestSeq;
  try{
    const result=await api(`/api/flow-audit/${kind==='procurement'?'procurement':kind}?${flowAuditQuery()}`);if(requestId!==flowAuditRequestSeq)return;
    if(kind==='health'){renderFlowAuditHealth(result);await loadFlowAuditRecommendations(kind);return;}
    const payload=result||{},summary=payload.summary||{};$('#flowAuditSummary').innerHTML=flowAuditSummaryTable(summary,kind==='sales'?'sales':'procurement');$('#flowAuditSupplemental').innerHTML=flowAuditSupplementalTable(payload.supplemental_rows||[]);
    const sales=kind==='sales';
    const headers=sales?['起點／來源','報價單／狀態','訂單／狀態','銷貨單／狀態','應收憑單／狀態','收款單／狀態','品號','訂單量','已銷貨','已銷退／折讓','剩餘量','剩餘金額','未轉應收／折讓','未收款','交期／到期日','逾期／帳齡','資金影響','下一階段','異常原因','稽核']:['起點／來源','請購單／狀態','採購單／狀態','進貨單／狀態','應付憑單／狀態','付款單／狀態','品號','採購量','已驗收','待進貨','待驗收／入庫','剩餘金額','未轉應付','未付款','預計／到期日','逾期／帳齡','資金影響','下一階段','異常原因','稽核'];
    $('#flowAuditHead').innerHTML=headers.map(x=>`<th>${x}</th>`).join('');const rows=payload.rows||[];
    $('#flowAuditRows').innerHTML=rows.map(row=>{const root=`<strong>${esc(row.source)}</strong><br><span class="flow-root-tag">${esc(row.root_type||row.trace_kind||'流程起點')}</span>${row.is_orphan?'<br><span class="flow-orphan">孤兒／未關聯</span>':''}`,dateCell=`${esc(displayDateOf(row.expected_date||row.due_date))}<br><small>交期／到期</small>`,lateCell=`${flowAuditNumber(row.overdue_days)} 天<br><small>${esc(row.aging_bucket||'未逾期')}</small>`,impact=flowAuditNumber(row.financial_impact),remainingAmount=flowAuditNumber(row.remaining_amount);
      return sales?`<tr><td>${root}</td><td>${esc(row.quote_no)}<br>${esc(row.quote_status)}</td><td>${esc(row.order_no)}<br>${esc(row.order_status)}</td><td>${esc(row.shipment_nos)}<br>${esc(row.shipment_statuses)}</td><td>${esc(row.ar_voucher_nos)}<br>${esc(row.ar_voucher_statuses||row.ar_open_item_statuses)}</td><td>${esc(row.ar_settlement_nos)}<br>${esc(row.ar_settlement_statuses)}</td><td>${esc(row.item_code)}<br>${esc(row.item_name)}</td><td>${flowAuditNumber(row.order_quantity)}</td><td>${flowAuditNumber(row.delivered_quantity)}</td><td>${flowAuditNumber(row.returned_amount)}</td><td>${flowAuditNumber(row.remaining_quantity)}</td><td>${remainingAmount}</td><td>${flowAuditNumber(row.unbilled_amount)}</td><td>${flowAuditNumber(row.uncollected_amount)}</td><td>${dateCell}</td><td>${lateCell}</td><td>${impact}</td><td>${esc(row.next_stage)}</td><td>${esc(row.exception_reason)}</td><td>${esc(row.audit_status)}</td></tr>`:`<tr><td>${root}</td><td>${esc(row.requisition_no)}<br>${esc(row.requisition_status)}</td><td>${esc(row.purchase_order_no)}<br>${esc(row.purchase_status)}</td><td>${esc(row.receipt_nos)}<br>${esc(row.receipt_statuses)}${row.purchase_return_nos?`<br>退：${esc(row.purchase_return_nos)}<br>${esc(row.purchase_return_statuses)}`:''}</td><td>${esc(row.ap_voucher_nos)}<br>${esc(row.ap_voucher_statuses||row.ap_open_item_statuses)}</td><td>${esc(row.ap_settlement_nos)}<br>${esc(row.ap_settlement_statuses)}</td><td>${esc(row.item_code)}<br>${esc(row.item_name)}</td><td>${flowAuditNumber(row.order_quantity)}</td><td>${flowAuditNumber(row.accepted_quantity)}</td><td>${flowAuditNumber(row.remaining_quantity)}</td><td>${flowAuditNumber(row.pending_inspection_quantity)}／${flowAuditNumber(row.pending_inventory_quantity)}</td><td>${remainingAmount}</td><td>${flowAuditNumber(row.unbilled_amount)}</td><td>${flowAuditNumber(row.unpaid_amount)}</td><td>${dateCell}</td><td>${lateCell}</td><td>${impact}</td><td>${esc(row.next_stage)}</td><td>${esc(row.exception_reason)}</td><td>${esc(row.audit_status)}</td></tr>`;}).join('')||`<tr><td colspan="${headers.length}" class="empty-hint">查無符合日期與公司別的流程資料</td></tr>`;
    await loadFlowAuditRecommendations(kind);
  }catch(error){if(requestId!==flowAuditRequestSeq)return;const target=kind==='health'?$('#flowAuditHealth'):$('#flowAuditRows');if(target)target.innerHTML=`<div class="empty-hint">載入失敗：${esc(error.message)}</div>`;const recommendation=$('#flowAuditRecommendations');if(recommendation)recommendation.innerHTML=`<div class="panel flow-audit-recommendations"><div class="panel-body"><div class="empty-hint">稽核建議暫無法載入：${esc(error.message)}</div></div></div>`;}
}
function renderFlowAuditHealth(data){
  const sales=data.sales||{},purchase=data.procurement||{},inventory=data.inventory||{},financial=data.financial||{},alerts=data.alerts||[];
  const card=(title,body,kind='')=>`<div class="panel flow-health-card ${kind}"><div class="panel-head">${title}</div><div class="panel-body">${body}</div></div>`;
  $('#flowAuditHealth').innerHTML=`<div class="row c4">${card('銷售／應收',`訂單 ${sales.order_count||0} 張／未銷貨 ${flowAuditNumber(sales.remaining_quantity)}／未收款 ${flowAuditNumber(sales.uncollected_amount)}<br>逾期 ${sales.overdue_count||0} 筆／逾期金額 ${flowAuditNumber(sales.overdue_amount)}<br>未轉報價 ${sales.unconverted_quote_count||0}／孤兒 ${sales.orphan_count||0}／異常 ${sales.exception_count||0}<br>資金影響 ${flowAuditNumber(sales.financial_impact)}`,'sales')}${card('採購／應付',`採購 ${purchase.purchase_order_count||0} 張／待進貨 ${flowAuditNumber(purchase.remaining_quantity)}／未付款 ${flowAuditNumber(purchase.unpaid_amount)}<br>逾期 ${purchase.overdue_count||0} 筆／逾期金額 ${flowAuditNumber(purchase.overdue_amount)}<br>未轉請購 ${purchase.unconverted_requisition_count||0}／孤兒 ${purchase.orphan_count||0}／異常 ${purchase.exception_count||0}<br>資金影響 ${flowAuditNumber(purchase.financial_impact)}`,'procurement')}${card('庫存／補充起點',`補充單據 ${inventory.document_count||0} 筆／孤兒 ${inventory.orphan_count||0}<br>異常 ${inventory.exception_count||0}／數量影響 ${flowAuditNumber(inventory.quantity_delta)}<br>金額影響 ${flowAuditNumber(inventory.amount_delta)}`,'inventory')}${card('逾期／資金總覽',`銷售待收 ${flowAuditNumber(financial.sales_pending)}<br>採購待付 ${flowAuditNumber(financial.procurement_pending)}<br>資金影響合計 ${flowAuditNumber(financial.total_pending)}<br>待處理警示 ${alerts.length} 筆`,'finance')}</div><div class="panel"><div class="panel-head">跨模組異常（含原因、帳齡與資金影響）</div><div class="panel-body"><div class="table-wrap"><table class="grid"><thead><tr><th>流程</th><th>來源／單號</th><th>來源日／預計日</th><th>逾期／帳齡</th><th>剩餘量／金額</th><th>資金影響</th><th>下一階段</th><th>異常原因</th></tr></thead><tbody>${alerts.map(row=>`<tr><td>${esc(row.flow)}</td><td><strong>${esc(row.source)}</strong><br><span class="flow-root-tag">${esc(row.root_type||row.trace_kind||'流程起點')}</span>${row.is_orphan?'<br><span class="flow-orphan">孤兒／未關聯</span>':''}</td><td>${esc(displayDateOf(row.source_date))}<br><small>預計／到期 ${esc(displayDateOf(row.expected_date||row.due_date)||'—')}</small></td><td>${flowAuditNumber(row.overdue_days)} 天<br><small>${esc(row.aging_bucket||'未逾期')}</small></td><td>${flowAuditNumber(row.remaining_quantity||row.pending_inspection_quantity||0)}<br>${flowAuditNumber(row.remaining_amount)}</td><td>${flowAuditNumber(row.financial_impact)}</td><td>${esc(row.next_stage)}</td><td>${esc(row.exception_reason)}</td></tr>`).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="8" class="empty-hint">目前查無待處理流程</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div></div></div>`;
}
